  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Contained within the 2nd Edition (1915) of the Atlas of Canada is a map that shows the geology of Eastern Canada. This map denotes the bedrock geology using letter codes and colours to indicate surface coverage. The legend includes the period and epoch the rock types were formed. Data is also shown for most of Newfoundland and Labrador, but was not part of Canada in 1915. It also includes major cities and railway systems."
